          "text": "Surgical procedures depend on the extent of obstruction—pyloromyotomy (Fredet- Ramstedt), pyloroplasty (Heineke-Mikulicz or antral advancement flap), gastroduodenostomy (Billroth 1), gastrojejunostomy (Billroth 2).",
          "pdf_page": 797,
          "printed_page": 715,
          "column": 1
        }
